      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "The §3Rocket Transporter Station§r is essential for sending and receiving cargo between celestial bodies.\n\n§3Transport rockets§r, similar to §3resource modules§r or §3Gas Giant Harvesters§r, automatically move various cargoes. To make the system work, you need at least one pair of linked platforms§r.\n\nThe platforms have compartments for outgoing and incoming items (blue and orange, respectively)§r, and they can handle liquids with §3dedicated buffers§r.\n\nTo link platforms, Shift+Right-Click with the §6Rocket Transporter Connector§r on one platform to save it, then Right-Click on another platform. To open the linker interface§r, Right-Click on a platform with the connector: it will display information about the linked platforms\u0027 locations.\n\nTo designate one of these points as the receiving point, click the button at the beginning of the row§r.\n\nTo launch the transporter rocket§r, the station must be fueled with §bliquid oxygen§r and §bhydrogen§r.",
